author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 720
acceptance_criteria: "validate and health select their reader from the fields they actually project, not unconditionally; A benchmark asserts a wall-clock ceiling for validate and health against a fixture corpus and fails when the ceiling is crossed; Whole-corpus commands avoid re-decoding item body text for fields available from the light metadata path"
parent: pm-9rxu
risk: high
confidence: high
resolution: fixed
expected_result: Governance reads avoid body decoding unless a requested check requires bodies and carry an enforced latency ceiling
actual_result: Health uses scalar metadata for its fast path; validate selects collection metadata and loads bodies only for history drift; independent cold 1000-item workspaces enforce sub-10000ms health and validate reads under instrumented full-suite contention
