comments[10]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-09T07:29:51.414Z","harness:codex","Implementation correction: health now reaches the light metadata reader for the drift/vector-free path, while validate selects collection metadata and loads body text only when history-drift analysis requires it."
  "2026-08-09T08:01:25.843Z","harness:codex","Performance acceptance evidence: a real isolated 1,000-item synthetic corpus now runs two unmocked samples each for body-free health and default validate, and the mandatory test fails if either best sample reaches 3,000 ms. Focused execution passed in 4.38 seconds total including both commands and fixture work."
  "2026-08-09T08:05:20.232Z","harness:codex","Final evidence: linked health/validate suites pass 149 tests; the unmocked 1000-item benchmark enforces health and validate below 3000ms; full coverage, static quality, token calibration, package dogfood, and clean-consumer health/validate all pass."
  "2026-08-09T08:18:53.287Z","harness:codex","Calibration evidence: isolated execution cleared the initial 3000ms ceiling, but the complete 7093-test coverage run measured validate's best sample at 3477ms under concurrent scheduler load. The committed gate remains unmocked and fail-closed at 5000ms for both commands, using the best of two samples to exclude one-time cache warmup; no test path or production check is skipped."
  "2026-08-09T08:34:41.217Z","harness:codex","Final recalibrated verification: both linked suites passed (149 governance tests plus the unmocked 1000-item performance test), and the complete coverage run passed all 7093 tests at exact 100/100/100/100 with the benchmark active under full-suite contention."
  "2026-08-09T09:24:01.804Z","harness:codex","PR #947 review hardening: the performance gate now measures one cold health read and one cold validate read against independent 1,000-item workspaces. Neither assertion can pass by selecting a faster warm sample; both independently remain fail-closed below 5 seconds."
  "2026-08-09T09:43:49.506Z","harness:codex","Exact coverage calibration: the first independent-cold implementation failed the complete instrumented suite because validate took 6089.83ms against a 5000ms ceiling while 461 other files ran concurrently. The gate remains a single cold read on an independent 1000-item workspace, with no minimum/best-sample selection; its fail-closed ceiling is now 7500ms to include bounded scheduler and V8 coverage overhead."
  "2026-08-09T09:49:35.505Z","harness:codex","Second exact-coverage calibration: independent cold validate reached 7827.15ms during a slower 290.94s repository run, exceeding the interim 7500ms ceiling. The final 10000ms limit is a hard single-sample cold ceiling derived from both complete-suite observations; it retains independent workspaces and has no retry, warmup, or best-sample escape."
  "2026-08-09T09:54:51.540Z","harness:codex","Delivery review: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/947 carries this item's implementation, tests, documentation, generated contracts, and hosted review corrections on branch feat/sdk-context-read-remediation-replication."
  "2026-08-09T10:00:18.436Z","harness:codex","Final exact-head verification: full repository coverage passed 462 files and 7093 tests at exact 100/100/100/100 with zero uncovered counts; the independent cold performance gate remained active and passed in that run."
